<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak VSZ posts lower 9-month net profit.</title>
<headline>Slovak VSZ posts lower 9-month net profit.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovak steel maker VSZ a.s. said on Tuesday it posted an after-tax profit of over 940 million crowns in the first nine months of the year, compared to a 1.1 billion crown net for the same period in 1995.</p>
<p>VSZ said in a statement it posted a pre-tax profit of 1.65 billion crowns for the first nine months. No comparative gross profit figures were immediately available.</p>
</text>
